===Noun===
{{en-noun|hadith|hadiths}}

# {{context|religion|Islam|lang=en}} Religious texts in Sunni, Ibadi and Shia Islam with [[collected]] [[saying]]s and [[action]]s of [[Muhammad]] and his companions as related by eyewitnesses, used to determine the [[Sunna]] ([[Muslim]] way of life).
#: ''There are four main Shia '''hadith''' books and six main Sunni '''hadith''' books

